{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261113/photo/bkn-20261113172315546-1113_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261113183516\"/><p>事主在大陂頭徑接受按摩服務時被盜竊。</p><p>今午(13日)3時19分，一名姓吳(58歲)男子受人兜搭，登上元朗大陂頭徑豐年樓一單位享受按摩服務。期間，年約40歲的按摩女趁他不察，擸起其脫下的一條約值5萬港元的金頸鏈，繼而奪門而逃。事主來不及追趕，無奈報案求助。執法部門了解事發經過後，將案件列作「盜竊」跟進，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:27.133416+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T09:23:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:49.031820+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:49.031820+00:00","content_hash":"54d07434dbcfe853447a3911b8b72560a9eae00fb1b73de8aaafb352376104af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}